  maxHealth: 380
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 13000
  description: Three stone faces, one sentence. The gavel burns because the verdict
    is always the same, and it reads the charges in rifts.
  tactics: 'THREE rift patterns run simultaneously by the Second Reading (difficulty
    7): gyres, rings, and crosses each claiming their own square. The screen becomes
    a calendar of eruptions - triage by timer, newest square first. It summons Curseweavers:
    now every kill decision has a price. The final phase adds dense rings; hold the
    bottom corners.'
  displayName: The Tribunal
  difficulty: 7
